# Sovereign Okinec Ahau (3/4). A +1/+1 counter makes power greater than base power (CR 613.4c: base power is set in 7a/7b, counters
# apply in 7c), so Okinec's own counters count the next time it attacks. Turn 3: Giant Growth takes Okinec to 6 power over base 3 and
# the attack trigger puts three counters on it (9/10 until end of turn, 6/7 after). The Ornithopter (0/2) stays at base and gets none:
# power equal to base power is not "greater" (CR 208.1). Turn 5: no pump, Okinec is 6/7 with power 6 over base 3, so the trigger
# puts three more (9/10) and the attack deals 9.

